                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is okay. It's VR minigolf using a pinball plunger. Grab the ball, pull the plunger backwards and release it to send the ball bouncing through the course towards the exit hole.\n\nI had fun beating it. *Looks at playtime* Oooooh, now I see why I can't recommend it.\n\nTruth be told, it is a fun experience. It looks great but the levels tend to feel small and even at full power your ball barely moves. While it functions fine, it does lack a satisfying oomph to every shot that tends to make minigolf video games exciting. \n\nIt feels like a really great tech demo but definitely not worth the price. You'd need one heck of a deep dive sale for me to thumbs up the game.",
